    "enUS": {
      "description": "Satisfaction. It is what I draw from the hammer and the anvil. To see a proud Horde warrior protected under my steel reminds me of what it is to be alive. It is an addiction that I dare never give up, {name}.\n\nI can not grant you this satisfaction, merely set you upon the path. As with all of life's endeavors, the path of the armorsmith is a journey.\n\nIf you wish to be one of the select few, you need only to ask and I shall train, but, a task you must first complete.",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Ornate Mithril Helm",
          "type": "item"
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Ornate Mithril Boots",
          "type": "item"
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Ornate Mithril Breastplate",
          "type": "item"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "To become an armorsmith, you must make the following items and return them to Okothos: 4 Ornate Mithril Helms, 2 Ornate Mithril Boots, 1 Ornate Mithril Breastplate.",
      "title": "The Art of the Armorsmith",
